  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\nMansfield Ave & Nassau Dr (#15195) (eastbound)\r\nMansfield Ave & Loyola Dr (#21868) (eastbound)\r\nMansfield Ave & S Yampa St (#23987) (eastbound)\r\nMansfield Ave & S Yampa St (#23988) (westbound)\r\nMansfield Ave & Loyola Pl (#15193) (westbound)\r\nMansfield Ave & Nassau Dr (#15196) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 139 get on/off buses at:\r\nMansfield Ave & S Truckee Ct (#15206)\r\nS Reservoir Rd & Mansfield Ave (#15197)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 139 get on/off buses at:\r\nS Reservoir Rd & Mansfield Ave (#18920)\r\nMansfield Ave & S Uravan St (#15203)"
